SELECT pg_temp.comment_if_exists('fact_journal_day', NULL, $c$Typed day-level pivot of the Whoop journal envelope (notes, cycle_id, sleep window). Source-of-truth for day-level journal data. fact_habit_log handles the per-behavior rows; this handles everything else. Grain: 1 row per day.. Gotchas: mart_daily.journal_notes is sourced from raw_whoop_journal.payload (legacy); a follow-up PR will swap it to fact_journal_day.notes. For now, prefer mart_daily.journal_notes.$c$);
